WEBVTT

00:00:07.854 --> 00:00:22.216
Iris Press Publishers, The Adventures of Six Friends by Yulia Puchkova Chapter 1 Six Friends There lived six little children.

00:00:22.276 --> 00:00:29.336
clever, fat, noisy, naughty, slow, and funny.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:32.800
They were all eight years old.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:36.162
Clever was a nice little girl.

00:00:36.222 --> 00:00:38.954
She was short and thin.

00:00:39.014 --> 00:00:43.796
She had long dark hair and big brown eyes.

00:00:43.856 --> 00:00:48.360
She liked reading, and she was very clever.

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.924
Fat was a nice little boy.

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:55.009
He was short and fat.

00:00:55.068 --> 00:00:59.662
He had short fair hair and grey eyes.

00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:03.274
He liked eating very much.

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:07.407
Noisy was a nice little girl.

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:10.238
She was tall and slim.

00:01:10.298 --> 00:01:16.133
She had long fair hair and big blue eyes.

00:01:16.192 --> 00:01:22.119
She liked talking and she was very noisy.

00:01:22.178 --> 00:01:26.322
Naughty was a nice little boy.

00:01:26.381 --> 00:01:29.492
He was tall and thin.

00:01:29.552 --> 00:01:35.583
He had short curly brown hair and big blue eyes.

00:01:35.643 --> 00:01:41.314
He liked riding a bike, and he was very naughty.

00:01:41.374 --> 00:01:45.135
Slow was a nice little girl.

00:01:45.195 --> 00:01:47.966
She was short and plump.

00:01:48.026 --> 00:01:51.038
She had long curly dark hair.

00:01:51.098 --> 00:01:53.330
and brown eyes.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:02:01.334
She liked wearing beautiful clothes, but she was very slow.

00:02:01.393 --> 00:02:05.455
Funny was a nice little boy.

00:02:05.515 --> 00:02:07.576
He was tall and thin.

00:02:07.636 --> 00:02:11.848
He had short fair hair and dark eyes.

00:02:11.908 --> 00:02:16.810
He liked walking, and he was very funny.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:31.208
They were in the same form, and they were friends.

00:02:31.268 --> 00:02:50.549
Chapter 2 Birthday Present It was Sunday, and it was Fat's Birthday.

00:02:50.608 --> 00:02:55.182
In the morning, his mum and dad came into his room.

00:02:55.242 --> 00:02:56.834
Wake up, dear.

00:02:56.894 --> 00:03:00.146
Happy birthday to you, they said.

00:03:00.206 --> 00:03:02.878
Here is your present.

00:03:02.938 --> 00:03:07.570
Fat opened his eyes and saw a bike.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:10.193
It was very beautiful.

00:03:10.252 --> 00:03:15.206
It was red and blue and had very big wheels.

00:03:15.266 --> 00:03:19.916
Oh, thank you very much, cried Fat.

00:03:19.976 --> 00:03:23.336
Can I go to the yard and cycle?

00:03:23.396 --> 00:03:27.128
Yes, you can, his parents said.

00:03:27.188 --> 00:03:29.170
But come home at noon.

00:03:29.229 --> 00:03:32.011
Your friends are coming at three o'clock.

00:03:32.071 --> 00:03:37.604
You must tidy your room, lay the table, and cook pizza."

00:03:37.664 --> 00:03:41.006
Okay, mummy," said Fat.

00:03:41.066 --> 00:03:42.256
Don't worry.

00:03:42.316 --> 00:03:44.718
I know I must do it."

00:03:44.777 --> 00:03:49.694
Fat's mum looked at him and said, Oh dear.

00:03:49.754 --> 00:03:51.670
Look out of the window.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.702
It's sunny and warm.

00:03:53.761 --> 00:03:57.376
Take off your trousers, jumper and trainers.

00:03:57.436 --> 00:04:03.002
Put on some shorts, a t-shirt and sandals.

00:04:03.062 --> 00:04:12.564
Fat took off the warm clothes and put on his yellow shorts, a red t-shirt and green sandals.

00:04:12.624 --> 00:04:21.982
Oh, I look cute, he said, when he looked in the mirror, and he went downstairs with his bike.

00:04:22.041 --> 00:04:45.318
Chapter 3 In the yard.

00:04:45.378 --> 00:04:51.502
In the yard he saw his friends, funny and naughty.

00:04:51.562 --> 00:04:54.184
They were on the playground.

00:04:54.244 --> 00:04:57.816
Hi, cried Fat.

00:04:57.876 --> 00:05:01.910
Oh, Fat, we're glad to see you.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.951
Happy birthday.

00:05:04.011 --> 00:05:07.094
Why do you look like traffic lights?

00:05:07.154 --> 00:05:09.165
Left naughty.

00:05:09.224 --> 00:05:10.812
I don't.

00:05:10.872 --> 00:05:14.350
I look cute, said Fat.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.713
What have you got?

00:05:16.772 --> 00:05:19.215
Asked Naughty.

00:05:19.274 --> 00:05:21.436
I've got a bike.

00:05:21.496 --> 00:05:23.728
It's my birthday present.

00:05:23.788 --> 00:05:25.290
Oh, great.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.830
Can I ride it?

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.982
Asked Naughty.

00:05:29.042 --> 00:05:30.844
Oh, Naughty.

00:05:30.904 --> 00:05:33.537
But I want to ride it myself.

00:05:33.596 --> 00:05:35.908
Said Fat.

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:38.070
Okay.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:40.470
Said Naughty.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:46.942
So Fat climbed upon his bike and started cycling.

00:05:47.002 --> 00:05:51.346
There was a small gate in the fence of the yard.

00:05:51.405 --> 00:05:54.728
Fat wanted to ride through the gate.

00:05:54.787 --> 00:06:04.215
But the gate was too small for him, so his bike went through and Fat got stuck in the gate.

00:06:04.275 --> 00:06:06.276
Help me!

00:06:06.336 --> 00:06:07.758
Help me!

00:06:07.818 --> 00:06:09.308
Cried Fat.

00:06:09.368 --> 00:06:11.783
Catch my bike!

00:06:11.843 --> 00:06:16.318
Funny and naughty ran to catch the bike.

00:06:16.378 --> 00:06:20.520
It wasn't easy, but at last they did it.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:25.304
They climbed upon the bike and came back to Fat.

00:06:25.364 --> 00:06:28.435
Oh, now help me please!

00:06:28.495 --> 00:06:31.177
I can't hang here like this.

00:06:31.236 --> 00:06:35.420
I must be at home at noon cried Fat.

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:39.282
Funny and naughty ran up to him.

00:06:39.342 --> 00:06:41.984
Oh, you look so funny!

00:06:42.044 --> 00:06:44.006
laughed funny.

00:06:44.066 --> 00:06:49.097
Don't laugh, please get me down, cried fat.

00:06:49.157 --> 00:06:56.560
Funny and naughty, first pulled him, then pushed him, but nothing helped.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:07:00.340
Run to my mum, cried fat.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:06.291
So funny and naughty, ran to fat's mum very fast.

00:07:06.351 --> 00:07:09.772
They told her all the story.

00:07:09.831 --> 00:07:15.286
She took a bottle of olive oil and ran to her poor son.

00:07:15.345 --> 00:07:22.840
When she came up to him, she opened the bottle and poured the oil down on fat.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.042
What are you doing?

00:07:25.102 --> 00:07:26.773
shouted Fat.

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:30.826
I'm helping you, dear, answered his mum.

00:07:30.886 --> 00:07:33.417
Oh, I'm falling!

00:07:33.477 --> 00:07:35.124
cried Fat.

00:07:35.184 --> 00:07:39.062
and fell down on the grass.

00:07:39.122 --> 00:08:09.074
Chapter 4 Fat Birthday Party So Fat went home with his mum and his bike.

00:08:09.134 --> 00:08:15.735
Mum put him into the bathtub and washed him with a lot of soap.

00:08:15.795 --> 00:08:20.966
When he was clean, it was half past two.

00:08:21.026 --> 00:08:24.847
Oh dear, cried Fat's mum.

00:08:24.907 --> 00:08:30.268
Your friends are coming soon, and we are not ready.

00:08:30.328 --> 00:08:34.332
So Fat went to tidy his room.

00:08:34.391 --> 00:08:39.186
and his mum went to cook pizza and lay the table.

00:08:39.246 --> 00:08:43.969
At ten past three, two of fat's friends came.

00:08:44.029 --> 00:08:47.980
They were funny and naughty.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:57.136
Happy birthday to you, said naughty, and gave fat a big bottle of olive oil.

00:08:57.195 --> 00:09:02.660
The boys laughed, but fat was angry.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:09.276
He wanted to cry, but his friend said, don't be angry.

00:09:09.336 --> 00:09:11.188
It's a joke.

00:09:11.248 --> 00:09:15.872
Best wishes on your ninth birthday.

00:09:15.932 --> 00:09:20.276
And they gave fat a big box.

00:09:20.336 --> 00:09:31.644
When fat opened it, saw a CD, a book about animals, and a big jar of jam.

00:09:31.704 --> 00:09:36.688
Thank you, friends," said Fat and smiled.

00:09:36.748 --> 00:09:39.740
They sat down to watch a cartoon.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.233
Soon came noisy and clever.

00:09:43.292 --> 00:09:50.018
They gave Fat a big cake, an apple pie, and a box of chocolates.

00:09:50.078 --> 00:09:52.830
Fat was happy.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:58.494
It was half past four, but slow wasn't there.

00:09:58.554 --> 00:10:02.820
Where is slow asked Fat?

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:06.076
We don't know," answered the children.

00:10:06.136 --> 00:10:08.090
Let's phone her.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:10.915
And they phoned slow.

00:10:10.975 --> 00:10:13.570
But she wasn't at home.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:17.063
So the children sat down at the table.

00:10:17.123 --> 00:10:28.084
They ate and drank, talked and watched films and cartoons, then they danced and sang, and clever played the piano.

00:10:28.144 --> 00:10:32.625
After that, they listened to new CDs.

00:10:32.685 --> 00:10:46.652
It was a very merry birthday party.

00:10:46.712 --> 00:10:58.000
CHAPTER V.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.760
SLOW IS COMING.

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:11.182
Hey, so, at four o'clock I started putting on this fifth dress and I was ready at half past four.

00:11:11.242 --> 00:11:15.912
I took my present for you and went downstairs.

00:11:15.972 --> 00:11:21.174
At quarter to five I was in the yard.

00:11:21.234 --> 00:11:26.386
It was raining, and I walked very slowly.

00:11:26.446 --> 00:11:32.800
I didn't want to make my beautiful shoes, socks, and dress dirty.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:36.121
And here I am.

00:11:36.181 --> 00:11:39.302
B.

00:11:39.363 --> 00:11:44.906
It was quarter to seven when slow came in.

00:11:44.966 --> 00:11:48.970
You are late, said fat.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:54.983
Yes, I'm terribly sorry, said slow.

00:11:55.044 --> 00:11:59.175
But you look beautiful, said fat.

00:11:59.235 --> 00:12:02.276
Thank you, said slow.

00:12:02.336 --> 00:12:05.777
It is the fifth dress.

00:12:05.837 --> 00:12:08.288
C.

00:12:08.348 --> 00:12:11.579
Slow gave fat her present.

00:12:11.639 --> 00:12:19.562
It was a jar of honey, a kilo of strawberries, and an interesting book with a lot of pictures.

00:12:19.622 --> 00:12:25.454
Fat thanked her, and they went into the room.

00:12:25.514 --> 00:12:28.316
D.

00:12:28.376 --> 00:12:35.354
I put on the first dress from 12 till half past 12.

00:12:35.414 --> 00:12:38.558
but I looked fat in it.

00:12:38.618 --> 00:12:44.390
I took it off from half past twelve till one o'clock.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:53.611
Then I tried a second dress, but it was too long and covered my beautiful shoes.

00:12:53.671 --> 00:12:59.792
The third was red, and I haven't got red shoes.

00:12:59.852 --> 00:13:14.952
The fourth was old and too short.

00:13:15.012 --> 00:13:32.296
Chapter 6 Good Friend It was Monday morning.

00:13:32.356 --> 00:13:35.530
Fat was in bed.

00:13:35.589 --> 00:13:38.843
His mum came to wake him up.

00:13:38.903 --> 00:13:43.798
Fat could hear her, but he couldn't get up.

00:13:43.858 --> 00:13:47.621
He had a terrible stomachache.

00:13:47.681 --> 00:13:49.582
Oh, no!

00:13:49.642 --> 00:13:52.154
It is your birthday party.

00:13:52.214 --> 00:13:57.079
You ate too many sweets yesterday, cried his mother.

00:13:57.139 --> 00:14:01.282
She phoned Fat's teacher.

00:14:01.342 --> 00:14:04.374
Mrs. Smart.

00:14:04.434 --> 00:14:06.312
My son is ill.

00:14:06.372 --> 00:14:08.493
He can't go to school.

00:14:08.553 --> 00:14:12.334
He has got a terrible stomachache."

00:14:12.394 --> 00:14:15.875
I see, said Mrs. Smart.

00:14:15.935 --> 00:14:18.886
I hope he feels better soon.

00:14:18.946 --> 00:14:22.897
I think it's his birthday party.

00:14:22.957 --> 00:14:27.148
So fat didn't go to school.

00:14:27.208 --> 00:14:29.299
He stayed in bed.

00:14:29.359 --> 00:14:34.732
In the afternoon, his friend Naughty visited him.

00:14:34.792 --> 00:14:37.336
How are you, fat?"

00:14:37.397 --> 00:14:39.368
asked Naughty.

00:14:39.428 --> 00:14:42.020
You look awful.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:45.002
I'm not well.

00:14:45.062 --> 00:14:49.826
My stomach hurts, answered fat.

00:14:49.886 --> 00:14:52.298
I see, said Naughty.

00:14:52.358 --> 00:14:57.642
So you mustn't eat your jam, honey, and sweets.

00:14:57.702 --> 00:15:03.196
No, I mustn't, answered fat.

00:15:03.256 --> 00:15:05.682
And it's awful.

00:15:05.742 --> 00:15:11.690
I like sweets, cakes, pies and chocolate so much.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:15.262
I can help you," said Naughty.

00:15:15.322 --> 00:15:17.522
I can eat them up.

00:15:17.582 --> 00:15:23.106
But fat started, but stopped.

00:15:23.166 --> 00:15:25.158
Okay.

00:15:25.218 --> 00:15:27.368
Eat them up.

00:15:27.428 --> 00:15:32.858
I am too fat, and I have got a stomachache.

00:15:32.918 --> 00:15:39.358
So naughty sat down at the table and started eating.

00:15:39.418 --> 00:15:42.750
Fat closed his eyes.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.523
He didn't want to see that.

00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:55.992
First, naughty ate all the cakes and slices of the pie, then all the sweets and chocolates.

00:15:56.052 --> 00:15:59.685
Fat opened his eyes.

00:15:59.745 --> 00:16:02.376
Thank you, he said.

00:16:02.436 --> 00:16:05.236
You are a very good friend.

00:16:05.296 --> 00:16:09.288
I hope your stomach is stronger than mine."

00:16:09.348 --> 00:16:13.408
On Tuesday, Fat went to school.

00:16:13.468 --> 00:16:16.999
But Naughty wasn't there.

00:16:17.059 --> 00:16:21.960
After school, Fat visited his friend.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:24.691
Naughty was in bed.

00:16:24.751 --> 00:16:30.321
He had a terrible toothache.

00:16:30.381 --> 00:16:47.904
Chapter 7 Catching Butterflies It was summer.

00:16:47.964 --> 00:17:00.856
The children were happy.

00:17:00.916 --> 00:17:04.327
There was a big field near their town.

00:17:04.387 --> 00:17:09.258
They went to the field to catch butterflies.

00:17:09.319 --> 00:17:12.039
Wow, look!

00:17:12.099 --> 00:17:16.941
What a beautiful butterfly cried noisy.

00:17:17.001 --> 00:17:20.542
I think I can catch it.

00:17:20.602 --> 00:17:24.312
Noisy ran after the butterfly.

00:17:24.372 --> 00:17:26.672
She ran and shouted.

00:17:26.733 --> 00:17:29.333
Oh, how fast it is flying!

00:17:29.393 --> 00:17:32.884
What beautiful spots it has got!

00:17:32.944 --> 00:17:37.355
Noisy, be quiet, said Clever.

00:17:37.415 --> 00:17:39.875
Don't shout all the time.

00:17:39.936 --> 00:17:42.736
The butterfly can hear you.

00:17:42.796 --> 00:17:45.727
Nonsense, said Noisy.

00:17:45.787 --> 00:17:51.142
First, I can't be quiet, because I'm noisy.

00:17:51.202 --> 00:17:59.852
Second, the butterfly can hear me, but it can't understand that I want to catch it.

00:17:59.912 --> 00:18:03.444
Why, as the children?

00:18:03.504 --> 00:18:07.757
Because it doesn't speak English.

00:18:07.817 --> 00:18:17.154
No, it doesn't speak English, but it can understand English, said clever.

00:18:17.214 --> 00:18:20.770
It is an English butterfly.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.554
My dog is English, too.

00:18:23.615 --> 00:18:30.018
She doesn't speak English, but she understands it very well.

00:18:30.078 --> 00:18:34.652
Oh, really, asked noisy.

00:18:34.712 --> 00:18:38.624
Then I must learn French or Spanish.

00:18:38.684 --> 00:18:53.496
I hope our butterflies can't understand these languages.

00:18:53.556 --> 00:19:13.688
Chapter 8 Dogs and Cats Fat had a cat.

00:19:13.748 --> 00:19:16.920
His name was Fluffy.

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:21.392
Fat loved him very much.

00:19:21.452 --> 00:19:26.902
He went with Fluffy to the park every day.

00:19:26.962 --> 00:19:32.582
They usually walked in the park in the afternoon.

00:19:32.642 --> 00:19:35.632
It was Thursday.

00:19:35.692 --> 00:19:38.834
It was time to go to the park.

00:19:38.894 --> 00:19:42.554
But fat didn't go.

00:19:42.614 --> 00:19:44.996
Fat?

00:19:45.056 --> 00:19:50.577
It's time to go for a walk with Fluffy, his mother said.

00:19:50.638 --> 00:19:52.788
I can't, Mum.

00:19:52.848 --> 00:19:55.048
I'm still doing my homework.

00:19:55.108 --> 00:19:59.539
I got a lot of homework today, said Fat.

00:19:59.599 --> 00:20:04.530
Okay, go later, said his mum.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:11.431
It was seven o'clock in the evening when Fat's homework was ready.

00:20:11.491 --> 00:20:16.392
He took Fluffy in his arms and off they went.

00:20:16.452 --> 00:20:21.212
They came to the park and sat down on the grass.

00:20:21.272 --> 00:20:25.523
Suddenly, Fat saw clever.

00:20:25.583 --> 00:20:29.544
She was with her dog, Dolly.

00:20:29.604 --> 00:20:32.295
Hey, clever.

00:20:32.355 --> 00:20:33.985
Shouted fat.

00:20:34.045 --> 00:20:35.246
Come here.

00:20:35.306 --> 00:20:37.736
Let's play together.

00:20:37.796 --> 00:20:41.067
Now clever saw fat.

00:20:41.127 --> 00:20:47.709
But at the same time, clever's dog saw fat's cat.

00:20:47.769 --> 00:20:51.939
Dolly was very angry.

00:20:51.999 --> 00:20:54.340
She didn't like cats.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:59.414
In fact, she hated cats.

00:20:59.474 --> 00:21:04.248
So she barked and ran to Fluffy.

00:21:04.308 --> 00:21:07.630
Fluffy wasn't silly.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:11.493
In fact, he was a very clever cat.

00:21:11.553 --> 00:21:17.158
He ran fast to the nearest tree and climbed it up.

00:21:17.218 --> 00:21:20.292
Now Fluffy sat in the tree.

00:21:20.352 --> 00:21:24.264
and Dolly jumped and barked under the tree.

00:21:24.324 --> 00:21:28.695
Clever and fat were under the tree, too.

00:21:28.755 --> 00:21:32.456
They didn't know what to do.

00:21:32.516 --> 00:21:36.817
Take away your dog, cried fat.

00:21:36.877 --> 00:21:39.828
I can't, cried clever.

00:21:39.888 --> 00:21:41.938
She's stronger than me.

00:21:41.998 --> 00:21:44.609
Do it yourself, please.

00:21:44.669 --> 00:21:49.858
Or climb up the tree and take your cat down.

00:21:49.918 --> 00:21:53.219
I can't, said Fat.

00:21:53.279 --> 00:21:56.512
Your dog is very angry.

00:21:56.572 --> 00:21:59.004
And she is barking.

00:21:59.064 --> 00:22:01.066
She can bite me.

00:22:01.126 --> 00:22:12.465
I'm afraid.

00:22:12.525 --> 00:22:31.774
Chapter 9 Great Idea At that moment, they saw funny.

00:22:31.834 --> 00:22:33.475
Hey!

00:22:33.535 --> 00:22:34.525
Funny!

00:22:34.585 --> 00:22:36.246
Help us!

00:22:36.306 --> 00:22:39.376
Clever and fat, shouted.

00:22:39.436 --> 00:22:43.998
Funny saw Dolly and Fluffy.

00:22:44.058 --> 00:22:48.430
Oh, I see, he said.

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:52.404
Your pets are not good friends.

00:22:52.464 --> 00:22:55.236
But what can I do?

00:22:55.296 --> 00:23:00.450
Get another cat, said clever.

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:05.534
Okay, said funny and ran away.

00:23:05.595 --> 00:23:09.418
Soon he came back.

00:23:09.478 --> 00:23:13.304
He had a cat in his arms.

00:23:13.364 --> 00:23:22.012
Show the cat to Dolly, commanded clever, and put it on the grass next to her.

00:23:22.072 --> 00:23:28.124
Funny, showed the cat to Dolly, and put it on the grass.

00:23:28.183 --> 00:23:36.586
Dolly looked at the cat for a moment and ran after it, and clever ran after Dolly.

00:23:36.646 --> 00:23:46.536
But the cat wasn't sillier than fluffy, it ran up to a tree, and climbed it up very fast.

00:23:46.596 --> 00:23:50.089
Thank you, funny, said Fat.

00:23:50.149 --> 00:23:52.570
Now he wasn't afraid.

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:57.254
He climbed up the tree and took Fluffy down.

00:23:57.314 --> 00:24:02.899
But poor clever was under another tree now.

00:24:02.959 --> 00:24:06.072
Oh, no, she said.

00:24:06.132 --> 00:24:08.853
That doesn't help.

00:24:08.913 --> 00:24:12.897
I can run to your parents, said Funny.

00:24:12.957 --> 00:24:17.430
But there at work now, said Clever.

00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:21.043
I know what to do, said Funny.

00:24:21.103 --> 00:24:22.424
Clever.

00:24:22.484 --> 00:24:26.456
Your house is near the park on the left.

00:24:26.516 --> 00:24:35.162
I can catch another cat, show it to Dolly, and put it on the grass on the left of this tree.

00:24:35.222 --> 00:24:42.076
I can do it again and again, and we can get to your house soon.

00:24:42.136 --> 00:24:46.797
That's a great idea, smiled fat.

00:24:46.857 --> 00:24:50.768
I'm sorry friends, but I must go.

00:24:50.828 --> 00:24:55.321
And he went away, very fast.

00:24:55.381 --> 00:25:06.086
When the twelfth cat was in a twelfth tree, clever and funny were opposite Clever's house.

00:25:06.146 --> 00:25:11.503
Clever saw her mum through an open window.

00:25:11.563 --> 00:25:14.278
You're back!

00:25:14.338 --> 00:25:15.890
Come here!"

00:25:15.950 --> 00:25:17.902
shouted Clever.

00:25:17.962 --> 00:25:22.874
Clever's mother ran out and took Dolly away.

00:25:22.934 --> 00:25:27.647
Clever told her all the story.

00:25:27.707 --> 00:25:31.960
Poor children laughed Clever's mother.

00:25:32.020 --> 00:25:47.300
Now let's have tea with sweets and forget cats.

00:25:47.360 --> 00:26:09.634
Chapter 10 Noisy Neighbors On Friday, clever and slow went to noisy.

00:26:09.694 --> 00:26:17.127
When they came in, they could hear a terrible noise in one of the rooms upstairs.

00:26:17.188 --> 00:26:21.428
They went there and saw noisy.

00:26:21.488 --> 00:26:24.470
What are you doing?

00:26:24.530 --> 00:26:27.010
Asked the girls.

00:26:27.070 --> 00:26:34.264
I'm asking my neighbours to be quiet, answered noisy.

00:26:34.324 --> 00:26:37.574
Why must they be quiet?

00:26:37.634 --> 00:26:40.026
Asked the girls.

00:26:40.086 --> 00:26:47.500
because my little brother is sleeping," answered Noisey.

00:26:47.560 --> 00:26:51.271
Are your neighbors making a noise?"

00:26:51.331 --> 00:26:53.762
asked Clever.

00:26:53.822 --> 00:27:05.248
No, they aren't yet, but I'm telling them that my brother is sleeping and that they mustn't make a noise.

00:27:05.308 --> 00:27:10.876
With these words, Noisey shouted out of the window.

00:27:10.936 --> 00:27:15.053
Mrs. Stout, can you hear me?

00:27:15.113 --> 00:27:18.293
My little brother is sleeping.

00:27:18.353 --> 00:27:22.284
Please don't make a noise till three o'clock.

00:27:22.344 --> 00:27:28.896
And then, Mr. Dixon, can you hear me?

00:27:28.956 --> 00:27:32.286
My little brother is sleeping.

00:27:32.346 --> 00:27:37.576
Please be quiet till three o'clock.

00:27:37.636 --> 00:27:41.866
How many neighbours have you got?"

00:27:41.926 --> 00:27:44.586
asked Slow.

00:27:44.646 --> 00:27:46.856
A lot.

00:27:46.916 --> 00:27:52.398
And they don't always hear me from the first time answered Noisy.

00:27:52.458 --> 00:27:55.528
I see, said Clever.

00:27:55.588 --> 00:28:01.659
Don't you see Noisy that it's you who is making the noise?

00:28:01.719 --> 00:28:06.231
I think you should walk to your neighbours.

00:28:06.292 --> 00:28:11.175
You shouldn't shout to them when your brother is sleeping.

00:28:11.235 --> 00:28:26.192
And I don't think he is said slow.

00:28:26.252 --> 00:28:49.325
Chapter 11 In the Country On Saturday, all the children went to the country together with their parents.

00:28:49.385 --> 00:28:56.150
The weather was sunny and hot.

00:28:56.210 --> 00:29:04.819
When they came to the place, the children went to the field to play.

00:29:04.879 --> 00:29:10.836
and their parents started working in the garden.

00:29:10.896 --> 00:29:17.152
When the children came up to the field, funny cried.

00:29:17.212 --> 00:29:18.944
Oh!

00:29:19.004 --> 00:29:23.658
Look at those big white dogs in the field!

00:29:23.718 --> 00:29:26.870
And they're eating grass!

00:29:26.930 --> 00:29:29.693
How funny!

00:29:29.753 --> 00:29:33.096
Clever looked at him and smiled.

00:29:33.156 --> 00:29:37.650
Is it the first time you are in the country?"

00:29:37.711 --> 00:29:41.294
she asked.

00:29:41.354 --> 00:29:45.567
They are not dogs.

00:29:45.627 --> 00:29:49.900
Those animals are goats, said clever.

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:52.582
Oh, goats.

00:29:52.642 --> 00:29:54.945
Now I know what they are like.

00:29:55.005 --> 00:29:57.538
I can make a poem about them.

00:29:57.598 --> 00:29:59.597
Listen.

00:29:59.657 --> 00:30:05.720
Those big goats have got white coats.

00:30:05.780 --> 00:30:11.655
They're eating the grass and looking at us.

00:30:11.715 --> 00:30:21.614
Well done, said clever, but I think they aren't looking at us.

00:30:21.674 --> 00:30:29.107
And naughty is looking at you, said Slow.

00:30:29.167 --> 00:30:32.536
naughty was red.

00:30:32.596 --> 00:30:35.258
I'm not looking at her.

00:30:35.318 --> 00:30:39.390
I'm listening to her," he said.

00:30:39.450 --> 00:30:43.552
Let's go to the river, said clever.

00:30:43.612 --> 00:30:48.315
But I haven't got my swimsuit on, said noisy.

00:30:48.375 --> 00:30:54.611
And I haven't got my swimming trunks, said funny.

00:30:54.671 --> 00:31:00.666
The water in the river is too cold.

00:31:00.726 --> 00:31:04.018
But we can see horses and cows there.

00:31:04.078 --> 00:31:08.650
They usually go there to drink water.

00:31:08.711 --> 00:31:19.686
When the children came to the river, clever said sadly, oh, I can't see any cows or horses.

00:31:19.746 --> 00:31:22.875
I only can see a sheep.

00:31:22.935 --> 00:31:24.793
Oh.

00:31:24.853 --> 00:31:26.264
A ship?

00:31:26.324 --> 00:31:27.424
Cried funny.

00:31:27.484 --> 00:31:28.934
We can sail on it.

00:31:28.994 --> 00:31:33.655
It's better than cows and horses.

00:31:33.716 --> 00:31:36.766
Funny.

00:31:36.826 --> 00:31:37.466
Look.

00:31:37.526 --> 00:31:38.906
It's not a ship.

00:31:38.966 --> 00:31:50.611
It's a sheep.

00:31:50.671 --> 00:32:13.564
Chapter 12 At the Zoo In August, the children and their parents came back to town.

00:32:13.624 --> 00:32:20.948
It was very boring in town after the Merry Summer in the countryside.

00:32:21.009 --> 00:32:26.902
So on Sunday, The children went to the zoo.

00:32:26.962 --> 00:32:28.972
Oh, look!

00:32:29.032 --> 00:32:33.964
There is a cheater in the cage over there, cried funny.

00:32:34.024 --> 00:32:37.005
Yes, I can see it.

00:32:37.065 --> 00:32:41.846
It's the fastest animal on the land, said clever.

00:32:41.906 --> 00:32:44.437
But it's not the strongest.

00:32:44.497 --> 00:32:48.918
I think lion is stronger, said noisy.

00:32:48.978 --> 00:32:52.864
But it's slower, said slow.

00:32:52.924 --> 00:32:58.582
But it's not the slowest animal, smiled fat.

00:32:58.642 --> 00:33:01.542
Who is the slowest?

00:33:01.602 --> 00:33:03.903
Asked noisy.

00:33:03.963 --> 00:33:10.215
Slow is the slowest, laughed naughty, and looked at slow.

00:33:10.275 --> 00:33:12.896
I'm not the slowest.

00:33:12.956 --> 00:33:17.888
The snail is slower than me, said slow.

00:33:17.948 --> 00:33:27.052
Yes, but it has got only one leg, and you have got two," said Naughty.

00:33:27.112 --> 00:33:34.314
Yes, but it's better to have one leg than it's not right or left.

00:33:34.374 --> 00:33:40.846
And I always mix them up when I put on my shoes, so it's easier for the snail.

00:33:40.906 --> 00:33:45.872
It can't mix up its legs, said Slow.

00:33:45.932 --> 00:33:49.708
Naughty smiled at slow.

00:33:49.768 --> 00:33:54.902
That's a pity the snail hasn't got any shoes, he laughed.

00:33:54.962 --> 00:33:57.244
Oh!

00:33:57.304 --> 00:34:01.236
I can see a panda over there, cried funny.

00:34:01.297 --> 00:34:04.029
What is it eating?

00:34:04.089 --> 00:34:08.782
It's eating bamboo leaves, said clever.

00:34:08.843 --> 00:34:10.334
Are they sweet?

00:34:10.394 --> 00:34:11.845
Ask fat.

00:34:11.904 --> 00:34:13.756
Do you want to try them?

00:34:13.816 --> 00:34:15.713
Ask naughty.

00:34:15.774 --> 00:34:17.520
Yes, I do.

00:34:17.580 --> 00:34:23.983
Please ask the panda for a leaf or two for me," said Fat, and smiled.

00:34:24.043 --> 00:34:26.295
Don't be greedy.

00:34:26.355 --> 00:34:41.170
You are much fatter than this poor panda," answered Naughty.

00:34:41.230 --> 00:34:52.872
Chapter 13.

00:34:52.932 --> 00:34:55.423
Python.

00:34:55.483 --> 00:35:00.744
Suddenly, slow, screamed.

00:35:00.804 --> 00:35:04.415
What the matter asked clever.

00:35:04.475 --> 00:35:05.865
Look!

00:35:05.925 --> 00:35:08.856
There's a long snake in a tree.

00:35:08.916 --> 00:35:11.246
Slow looked afraid.

00:35:11.306 --> 00:35:15.126
All the children looked at the tree.

00:35:15.186 --> 00:35:16.846
Don't worry.

00:35:16.906 --> 00:35:18.617
It's a python.

00:35:18.677 --> 00:35:20.458
It's sleeping.

00:35:20.518 --> 00:35:24.040
It is beautiful, said clever.

00:35:24.100 --> 00:35:26.282
Or handsome.

00:35:26.342 --> 00:35:30.204
If it is he, said naughty.

00:35:30.264 --> 00:35:35.978
Noisy looked at them and said, But why is it here?

00:35:36.038 --> 00:35:39.991
What is it doing here in the tree?

00:35:40.051 --> 00:35:41.652
Who is it?

00:35:41.712 --> 00:35:44.402
Where is it from?

00:35:44.462 --> 00:35:48.874
I think it lives here in the zoo," said Clever.

00:35:48.935 --> 00:35:53.408
I hope somebody is taking him for a walk.

00:35:53.468 --> 00:35:58.933
The children looked around and saw two women.

00:35:58.993 --> 00:36:04.088
The python is theirs, shouted fat.

00:36:04.148 --> 00:36:11.566
Clever came up to the women, pointed to the python and asked, is it yours?

00:36:11.626 --> 00:36:18.222
The women looked up, screamed, and ran away, very fast.

00:36:18.282 --> 00:36:19.702
Oops!

00:36:19.762 --> 00:36:23.706
It's not theirs, but why did they run away?

00:36:23.766 --> 00:36:25.886
Asked funny.

00:36:25.946 --> 00:36:31.080
I think they ran to find the zookeeper and said slow.

00:36:31.140 --> 00:36:36.304
So we must guard the python till the zookeeper comes.

00:36:36.364 --> 00:36:45.250
So the children sat down on the grass, took out their sandwiches, and started their lunch.

00:36:45.310 --> 00:36:46.981
Chapter 14.

00:36:47.041 --> 00:37:00.162
Lunch for Python.

00:37:00.223 --> 00:37:20.508
So looked at the python and said, I think the poor python is very hungry.

00:37:20.568 --> 00:37:24.550
Let's give it a piece of ham.

00:37:24.610 --> 00:37:30.102
Oh yes, a great idea cried the children.

00:37:30.162 --> 00:37:32.524
But how can we do that?

00:37:32.584 --> 00:37:35.324
It's very high in the tree.

00:37:35.384 --> 00:37:40.998
I can climb up the tree and give it the food said fat.

00:37:41.058 --> 00:37:42.689
Can you?

00:37:42.749 --> 00:37:47.644
As the children, you're very brave.

00:37:47.704 --> 00:37:51.748
Flaps was very proud.

00:37:51.808 --> 00:38:01.048
He put his food on the grass, took a big piece of ham out of his sandwich, and started climbing up the tree.

00:38:01.108 --> 00:38:07.550
But it was difficult to do it with the piece of ham in his hand.

00:38:07.610 --> 00:38:15.052
So Fat said, take the ham and throw it back to me when I'm up.

00:38:15.112 --> 00:38:20.816
He climbed and climbed and climbed.

00:38:20.876 --> 00:38:31.528
Now he was high in the tree, but the python was on a thin branch at the very end of it.

00:38:31.589 --> 00:38:37.064
So fat started climbing up that branch.

00:38:37.124 --> 00:38:52.138
Suddenly there was an awful noise, and all the three of them fell down on the grass, the python, the branch, and fat.

00:38:52.198 --> 00:38:54.449
Are you okay?

00:38:54.509 --> 00:38:56.318
Asked funny.

00:38:56.378 --> 00:38:58.378
Yes, said Fat.

00:38:58.438 --> 00:39:00.429
I only hit my leg.

00:39:00.490 --> 00:39:04.033
All is well that ends well, said Clever.

00:39:04.093 --> 00:39:07.956
The python is here, and the ham is here.

00:39:08.016 --> 00:39:10.538
Now we can feed it easily.

00:39:10.598 --> 00:39:20.867
The python opened its eyes, smelled the ham, ate it up, and closed its eyes again.

00:39:20.927 --> 00:39:24.966
What a nice python said slow.

00:39:25.026 --> 00:39:27.902
It's so cute and quiet.

00:39:27.962 --> 00:39:31.062
I think we should give it some water to drink.

00:39:31.082 --> 00:39:57.184
Chapter 15 Zookeeper comes.

00:39:57.244 --> 00:40:02.199
At that moment, they saw a tall man.

00:40:02.259 --> 00:40:04.882
He looked very angry.

00:40:04.942 --> 00:40:10.456
He ran up to them and shouted, What are you doing here?

00:40:10.516 --> 00:40:14.329
You mustn't climb trees in the zoo.

00:40:14.389 --> 00:40:17.382
But we're not climbing trees.

00:40:17.442 --> 00:40:21.699
We're guarding your python, said the children.

00:40:21.759 --> 00:40:28.018
The zookeeper looks down on the grass and saw the python.

00:40:28.078 --> 00:40:35.374
Now everyone saw that it was a very long and thick python.

00:40:35.434 --> 00:40:39.608
Oh good children, I'm sorry.

00:40:39.668 --> 00:40:41.989
Thank you very much.

00:40:42.050 --> 00:40:47.074
Can you help me to carry the python back to its cage?

00:40:47.134 --> 00:40:49.772
Ask the zookeeper.

00:40:49.832 --> 00:40:52.568
Yes, we can!"

00:40:52.628 --> 00:40:54.449
cried the children.

00:40:54.510 --> 00:41:01.114
And everyone who was at the zoo that day could see a funny line of people.

00:41:01.174 --> 00:41:03.895
The first was the zookeeper.

00:41:03.955 --> 00:41:06.106
The second was fat.

00:41:06.167 --> 00:41:09.878
The third and the fourth was slow and noisy.

00:41:09.938 --> 00:41:13.801
The fifth and sixth were funny and clever.

00:41:13.861 --> 00:41:17.413
And the seventh was naughty.

00:41:17.474 --> 00:41:20.430
They went one after another.

00:41:20.490 --> 00:41:26.138
and each of them held a piece of the long python in their hands.

00:41:26.198 --> 00:41:54.356
Chapter 16 Back to School It was autumn again.

00:41:54.416 --> 00:41:57.867
It was time to go to school.

00:41:57.927 --> 00:42:01.938
The children came to school on Monday.

00:42:01.998 --> 00:42:12.602
They had five lessons—history, science, art, English, and PE.

00:42:12.662 --> 00:42:17.004
What is your favourite subject, funny?

00:42:17.064 --> 00:42:19.565
Asked Naughty.

00:42:19.625 --> 00:42:24.779
I like pe answered funny, do you?

00:42:24.840 --> 00:42:28.622
Yes, I like pe too.

00:42:28.682 --> 00:42:32.786
But my favorite subject is art.

00:42:32.846 --> 00:42:39.622
I like drawing and painting very much, and you, fat and clever.

00:42:39.682 --> 00:42:45.903
I like science because I like animals, said fat.

00:42:45.963 --> 00:42:53.276
I like all the subjects, but my favorite is history," said Clever.

00:42:53.337 --> 00:42:55.860
I don't like history.

00:42:55.920 --> 00:42:59.133
It's boring, said Noisy.

00:42:59.193 --> 00:43:01.424
How do you know?

00:43:01.484 --> 00:43:03.697
You never listen to the teacher.

00:43:03.758 --> 00:43:07.222
You always talk, said Slow.

00:43:07.282 --> 00:43:21.502
Yes, I always do when I sit with Mary, but at history lessons I sit with quiet and she is very boring," said Noisey.

00:43:21.562 --> 00:43:27.146
After science, the children had art.

00:43:27.206 --> 00:43:33.873
The teacher of art, Mr. Pencil, was a very kind and funny man.

00:43:33.933 --> 00:43:40.636
He asked the children to sit down and said, I'm glad to see you again.

00:43:40.696 --> 00:43:46.508
Today we are going to draw or paint animals.

00:43:46.568 --> 00:43:51.781
I hope you all have got a favourite animal.

00:43:51.841 --> 00:43:56.263
Maybe it's your pet or a farm animal.

00:43:56.323 --> 00:43:59.474
Maybe you saw it at the zoo.

00:43:59.534 --> 00:44:02.441
Now start.

00:44:02.501 --> 00:44:08.410
all the children started drawing or painting.

00:44:08.470 --> 00:44:15.875
Mr. Pencil walked around the classroom and looked at the children's pictures.

00:44:15.935 --> 00:44:18.917
What are you drawing slow?

00:44:18.977 --> 00:44:22.470
He asked when he came up to slow.

00:44:22.530 --> 00:44:24.610
I'm drawing a panda.

00:44:24.670 --> 00:44:28.204
I saw it at the zoo said slow.

00:44:28.264 --> 00:44:31.045
And what are you drawing funny?

00:44:31.105 --> 00:44:33.334
Asked Mr. Pencil.

00:44:33.394 --> 00:44:35.894
I am drawing a goat.

00:44:35.955 --> 00:44:39.536
I saw it in the country," said Funny.

00:44:39.596 --> 00:44:43.130
Clever painted her dog Dolly.

00:44:43.190 --> 00:44:46.612
Noisy drew the python from the zoo.

00:44:46.672 --> 00:44:50.454
Fat drew his cat, fluffy.

00:44:50.514 --> 00:44:54.607
Then Mr. Pencil came up to Naughty.

00:44:54.668 --> 00:44:58.081
He saw a picture of a man.

00:44:58.141 --> 00:45:02.163
Why are you painting a man?

00:45:02.224 --> 00:45:09.095
I asked you to paint your favorite animal, said Mr. Pencil, angrily.

00:45:09.155 --> 00:45:22.967
Yes, I know, answered Naughty, but our science teacher said at the lesson that people are animals too, and you are my favorite teacher.

00:45:23.027 --> 00:45:29.518
I'm painting you, Mr. Pencil, smiled Naughty.

00:45:29.578 --> 00:46:00.600
Chapter 17 Those Rolls and Buns It was Tuesday afternoon.

00:46:00.660 --> 00:46:04.081
Fat walked along the street.

00:46:04.141 --> 00:46:08.562
Suddenly he saw funny.

00:46:08.622 --> 00:46:11.812
Hey, funny.

00:46:11.872 --> 00:46:14.363
Hello, fat.

00:46:14.423 --> 00:46:16.303
Where are you going?

00:46:16.363 --> 00:46:18.074
Asked funny.

00:46:18.134 --> 00:46:23.214
First I'm going to the bakers to buy some rolls and buns.

00:46:23.274 --> 00:46:27.114
And then I'm going to the grocers.

00:46:27.174 --> 00:46:32.274
I must buy some flour and some sugar for mum.

00:46:32.334 --> 00:46:37.486
Come with me," answered Fat and smiled.

00:46:37.546 --> 00:46:42.469
Oh, Fat, I don't think rolls and buns are good for you.

00:46:42.529 --> 00:46:47.182
You mustn't eat them every day, said Funny.

00:46:47.242 --> 00:46:49.472
Why?

00:46:49.532 --> 00:46:51.973
I'm already Fat.

00:46:52.034 --> 00:46:55.474
They are so tasty.

00:46:55.534 --> 00:47:00.174
and fat smiled again.

00:47:00.234 --> 00:47:05.905
So you want to be fatter, I see, said funny.

00:47:05.965 --> 00:47:07.815
No, I don't.

00:47:07.876 --> 00:47:11.526
I can't run well, because I'm too fat.

00:47:11.586 --> 00:47:17.068
But I can't live without rolls and buns, cried fat.

00:47:17.128 --> 00:47:19.548
Listen, fat.

00:47:19.608 --> 00:47:23.080
I'm your best friend," said Funny.

00:47:23.140 --> 00:47:27.962
I shouldn't go to the bakers and buy rolls and buns for you.

00:47:28.022 --> 00:47:31.575
I shouldn't do what is bad for you.

00:47:31.635 --> 00:47:46.986
Besides, I must go to the butchers to buy some meat, buy, buy, said fat, sadly, and walked on.

00:47:47.046 --> 00:47:50.829
But funny, didn't go to the butchers.

00:47:50.889 --> 00:48:00.482
He turned left into another street, and then turned right, and ran to the bakers very fast.

00:48:00.542 --> 00:48:11.544
He ran into the baker's shop, closed the door, and shouted, Mr. Pie, you must know my friend, Fat.

00:48:11.605 --> 00:48:14.005
He's going here now.

00:48:14.065 --> 00:48:17.468
He's going to buy rolls and buns.

00:48:17.528 --> 00:48:21.362
But he's already too fat.

00:48:21.422 --> 00:48:26.167
Please, don't sell them to him.

00:48:26.227 --> 00:48:29.659
But how can I do that?"

00:48:29.720 --> 00:48:32.202
asked Mr. Pie.

00:48:32.262 --> 00:48:37.446
You must take all the rolls and buns away from the counters.

00:48:37.506 --> 00:48:41.690
Please, Mr. Pie, do it for me and for him.

00:48:41.750 --> 00:48:45.414
I can help you, cried funny.

00:48:45.474 --> 00:48:53.828
Okay, said Mr. Pie, and they took away all fat favorite foods.

00:48:53.888 --> 00:49:17.360
Chapter 18 Helpful woman.

00:49:17.420 --> 00:49:24.212
When fat came in, he didn't see any rolls and buns in the shop.

00:49:24.272 --> 00:49:28.373
Good afternoon, Mr. Pie.

00:49:28.433 --> 00:49:33.634
Can I buy some rolls and buns, asked fat?

00:49:33.694 --> 00:49:41.387
I'm very sorry, but we haven't got any rolls and buns at the moment, said Mr. Pie.

00:49:41.447 --> 00:49:44.340
Oh no, cried fat.

00:49:44.400 --> 00:49:47.004
I need them so much."

00:49:47.064 --> 00:49:54.749
I'm terribly sorry, repeated Mr. Pie, and he was really very sorry.

00:49:54.809 --> 00:49:57.782
Fats went out of the shop.

00:49:57.842 --> 00:50:01.594
He turned left and went to the grocers.

00:50:01.654 --> 00:50:04.166
He was very sad.

00:50:04.226 --> 00:50:08.959
He wanted rolls and buns, very much.

00:50:09.019 --> 00:50:13.781
In the evening, funny phoned fat.

00:50:13.841 --> 00:50:16.190
Hello, fat.

00:50:16.250 --> 00:50:17.852
What are you doing?"

00:50:17.912 --> 00:50:19.643
he asked.

00:50:19.703 --> 00:50:22.254
I'm having tea.

00:50:22.314 --> 00:50:24.956
Come to me, said fat.

00:50:25.016 --> 00:50:28.278
His voice was happy.

00:50:28.338 --> 00:50:31.780
Hooray, smiled funny.

00:50:31.840 --> 00:50:37.544
He can live without rolls and buns, and he can be happy.

00:50:37.604 --> 00:50:42.810
He ran downstairs and on to fat's house.

00:50:42.870 --> 00:50:49.548
When fat opened the door, funny opened his mouth.

00:50:49.608 --> 00:50:52.700
What's the matter with you, funny?

00:50:52.760 --> 00:50:56.654
You don't look happy, ask fat.

00:50:56.714 --> 00:51:00.406
Where did you get that bun?

00:51:00.466 --> 00:51:05.630
Asked funny, looking at the big bun in fat's hand.

00:51:05.690 --> 00:51:09.332
Did you buy it at the bakers?

00:51:09.392 --> 00:51:11.462
Oh, no.

00:51:11.522 --> 00:51:14.913
There were no rolls and buns there.

00:51:14.973 --> 00:51:21.345
But then I went to the grocers to buy some flour and sugar for mum.

00:51:21.405 --> 00:51:25.506
There I met a very nice woman.

00:51:25.566 --> 00:51:28.606
She likes rolls and buns too.

00:51:28.666 --> 00:51:31.477
But she doesn't usually buy them.

00:51:31.537 --> 00:51:33.368
She cooks them.

00:51:33.428 --> 00:51:37.689
She taught me how to cook tasty buns.

00:51:37.749 --> 00:51:39.282
She is here.

00:51:39.342 --> 00:51:41.246
She is helping me.

00:51:41.306 --> 00:51:43.639
I think you know her.

00:51:43.699 --> 00:51:45.561
She is Mrs. Pie.

